{"3807080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ballotoro", "steam_appid": 3807080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballotoro. Where chaos rules and nothing makes sense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.poster.avif?t=1752305030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.webm?t=1752305030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.mp4?t=1752305030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game lies to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It throws noise, chaos, and half-truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then dares you to make sense of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no clear path, no safe meta, no perfectly solved build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll — things happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it works. Sometimes it explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t master it by memorizing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll thrive by adapting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballotoro</strong> is for players burned out by predictable formulas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hand-holding. No tutorials explaining everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just motion, momentum, and incomplete information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you look, the more it reveals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But only if you’re paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feeling lost — then figuring it out.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Taming randomness into rhythm.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>That moment when noise becomes signal.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short game that you can finish in one go.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ballotoro. Where chaos rules and nothing makes sense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.poster.avif?t=1752305030\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.webm?t=1752305030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807080/extras/bbe76f620eaa15a6fd28243496b3f0d1.mp4?t=1752305030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game lies to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It throws noise, chaos, and half-truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then dares you to make sense of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no clear path, no safe meta, no perfectly solved build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You roll — things happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes it works. Sometimes it explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t master it by memorizing.</p><p class=\"bb_parag